# --- Data (cache/derived are reproducible via `make ingest`; never commit large binaries) ---
data/cache/*
!data/cache/.gitkeep
data/derived/*
!data/derived/.gitkeep
*.tif
*.tiff
*.parquet
*.pmtiles

# Exception: the locked demo neighborhood's own derived outputs (~15 MB,
# docs/adr/0030-*.md). These are what the deployed app actually reads at
# request time (engine/optimize/plan_service.py's own docstring: it reads
# the cache, it never recomputes the 20-90 min cold pipeline live) -- a
# production deploy with no persistent volume and no source-data
# credentials has nowhere else to get them. Regenerable from real sources
# via `uv run python scripts/export_map_layers.py` /
# `export_heat_surface.py`; committed here so a fresh clone or a fresh
# Render deploy can run without that ~20-90 min ingest first. Scrubbed of
# `owner_name` before export (private parcel-owner names never belong in
# a public repo) -- everything else here is already public government/
# open data (Census, CDC, OSM, Landsat, Sentinel-2, Maricopa County
# parcels by APN, not by owner).
#
# `population_scored.geojson` (docs/adr/0032-*.md) is the one file in
# here that exists *only* because a deploy target must never need
# `data/cache/maricopa_parcels/` (real names + home addresses) just to
# answer a solve request -- it is not a map layer like the rest.
!data/derived/edison-eastlake/
!data/derived/edison-eastlake/*.geojson
!data/derived/edison-eastlake/*.tif
!data/derived/edison-eastlake/*.pmtiles

# Same reasoning, for the three raw-cache sources request-time code still
# reads directly (docs/adr/0032-*.md): Census block-group boundaries
# (TIGER), Census ACS5 block-group aggregates, and Tree Equity Score by
# block group -- all public government open data at block-group
# granularity (never an individual record), unlike `maricopa_parcels`
# (excluded on purpose, real names + home addresses -- never committed).
!data/cache/tiger_block_groups/
!data/cache/tiger_block_groups/**/block_groups.parquet
!data/cache/census_acs5/
!data/cache/census_acs5/**/acs5_block_groups.parquet
!data/cache/tree_equity_score/
!data/cache/tree_equity_score/**/tes_block_groups.parquet

